def root_link(match):
    target = match.group(1)
    return '](' + (target[3:] if target.startswith('../') else 'resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/' + target) + ')'
handoff = re.sub(r'\]\(([^)]+)\)', root_link,
                 body.replace('# Major step019 - reviewed copied tests and compact proof design; live ownership unresolved',
                              '# Current pro2 handoff - major step019')).encode('utf-8')
start = b'''# Start here

Read [HANDOFF](HANDOFF.md), [checkpoint019](resume-2026-10-01-30h-001/30H_RESUME_CHECKPOINT_019.md) and newest [SESSION](resume-2026-09-28-001/SESSION.md).

Gate008 data is accepted for D177 only. Gate009 has a terminal failure receipt after one accepted partition; no final or continuation acceptance is established. Canonical apply, gates, release and native remain held without sole-executor coordination.

