resource_entry = f'''

### {stamp} - major019 terminal metadata and continued resource hold

[Snapshot](ROOT019_RESOURCE_OBSERVATION_001.json)06:47:39UTC RAM2030669824bytes/D296623853568bytes is time-local only. PID62728 path/creation observed; ownership and RAMcause unproved/no process changes. [Coordination012](COORDINATION_GATE009_TIMEOUT_RESOURCE_REQUEST_012.md) has localPro3copy/no delivery/ACK. Pro3ACK007 component/heavy/qualification120s requestHELD/no new modewindow. Gate009failedreceipt1accepted/nullresult doesnotauthorizecontinuation/lease/nativequiet. Guard14/metadata24UNRUN; copiedscope two wholeinventorytrees+four runtimefiles, not4trees/allsite/loadedcode. Rootcanonicalheld/keeperconsumed/monitorrestorecloseout; [checkpoint019](30H_RESUME_CHECKPOINT_019.md).
